Package: cori.data.pep
Type: Package
Title: Access and Analyze Census Bureau Population Estimates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Drew", "Rosebush", email = "drew.rosebush@ruralinnovation.us", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Access and analyze U.S. Census Bureau Population Estimates Program
    (PEP) data at the county level from 2000 to present. Provides tools to
    download population totals, population age 16+, and components of change
    (births, deaths, migration) from Census Bureau files, write processed data
    to S3, and read it back via DuckDB.
